3. Still open (as of 2026-09-14)
=====================================================================

 "Finger in front of camera, CAPTURE & CHECK shows no finger" was reported while the
 live view was 20 s stale. That check path never touched the push stream and its
 buffer is proven fresh, so it is NOT explained by the above. Re-test now that the
 live view is real-time: if the finger shows live but not in the check result, look
 at the camera's H.264 GOP settings (Bosch "Auto" keyframe interval can be up to 255
 frames ~ 8.5 s; IBP/IBBP GOPs add decode-reorder delay). A raw-NAL I/P/B parse was
 started and not finished.
